WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.450
This is sodium: a dangerous metal.

2
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.330
This is chlorine: a poisonous gas.

3
00:00:06.380 --> 00:00:07.730
When they meet, you get…

4
00:00:07.780 --> 00:00:09.250
table salt.

5
00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:11.270
The stuff you sprinkle on your food.

6
00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:15.430
So how can two dangerous substances
make something you can eat?

7
00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:17.630
To find out, we need to zoom in,

8
00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:20.630
much further than a normal
microscope can see,

9
00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:22.590
down to the atoms.

10
00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:25.950
There are only a hundred and
eighteen known types of atom.

11
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:29.690
Yet they build everything
around you, including you.

12
00:00:29.740 --> 00:00:32.650
In this mission, you'll find
out what makes an element,

13
00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:35.370
a compound and a mixture different.

14
00:00:35.420 --> 00:00:39.070
Your mission: explain
why salt is safe to eat.
